        "y0": 0.6502525252525253,
        "x1": 0.47944018420051127,
        "y1": 0.6641414141414141
      },
      "text": "i.e., measurements are made at the extreme tempera-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
