        "y0": 0.7032828282828283,
        "x1": 0.46337750378777,
        "y1": 0.7171717171717171
      },
      "text": "use DARHT’s flash x-ray machine and cameras to",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5036195742538552,
        "y0": 0.7032676658245048,
        "x1": 0.8414561951082516,
        "y1": 0.7171565547133937
      },
      "text": "• are concerned with case and other device",
