        "x0": 0.07752728929706648,
        "y0": 0.8446969696969697,
        "x1": 0.4728981965507557,
        "y1": 0.8585858585858586
      },
      "text": "date both types of hydrotests, it is the world’s most",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
